  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "F24Kicker",
      "text": "A SELF GUIDED VISIT"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Museum learning trail"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Three small investigations"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Look closely at an object. Notice a detail, test a guess and leave with a question. Choose one stop or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24DialogueFirst",
      "text": "GUIDE You do not need to know the answer."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24DialogueLast",
      "text": "YOU I can start with something I notice."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Choose your route"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Checkpoint",
      "text": "01 A closer look / page 2"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Find a container. Separate a visible clue from a possible use."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Checkpoint",
      "text": "02 Follow a pattern / page 3"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Find repeated marks. Look for one change in the pattern."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Checkpoint",
      "text": "03 A question about time / page 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Find a timepiece. Ask what its appearance cannot tell you."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Make the visit work for you"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Work alone or share the reading. Write, draw, talk softly or think quietly. You can use only the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Ask staff which spaces are available and where you may pause. Keep a comfortable distance from…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Stop whenever you wish. One careful observation is enough to complete this trail."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Footer",
      "text": "EXAMPLE TRAIL / Invented drawings, no real gallery route / 1 of 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Kicker",
      "text": "STOP 01"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "A closer look"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Find a cup, bowl or another container you can view safely. If none is available, use the drawing below."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24PanelLabel",
      "text": "PANEL 1 / NOTICE"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24DialogueFirst",
      "text": "GUIDE What detail can you see?"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24DialogueLast",
      "text": "YOU I notice a mark, an edge or a shape."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose one detail. Describe its shape or position before guessing what the object was used for."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24PanelLabel",
      "text": "PANEL 2 / TEST A GUESS"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What might that detail help someone do? Point to the clue behind your idea. More than one explanation…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Response",
      "text": "One visible detail / One possible use"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Alternative",
      "text": "Another way: say your observation, point without touching, or hold the idea in your mind. Drawing is…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Checkpoint",
      "text": "CHECKPOINT / Can you separate your clue from your guess?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Continue to a patterned object on page 3, or finish by choosing one question you would like to ask."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Footer",
      "text": "EXAMPLE TRAIL / Container drawing is invented / 2 of 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Kicker",
      "text": "STOP 02"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Follow a pattern"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Find a patterned object such as cloth, a tile or a decorated vessel. If none is available, use the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24PanelLabel",
      "text": "PANEL 1 / FOLLOW"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24DialogueFirst",
      "text": "GUIDE Which mark appears more than once?"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24DialogueLast",
      "text": "YOU I can follow a line and look for a change."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose a repeated shape. Follow it with your eyes. Find one place where the spacing, direction or shape…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24PanelLabel",
      "text": "PANEL 2 / COMPARE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Show or describe the repeated mark and the change. What does comparing them help you notice?"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Response",
      "text": "The repeated mark / One change I notice"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Alternative",
      "text": "Another way: name two shapes, trace the pattern in the air away from the object, or compare quietly. No…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Checkpoint",
      "text": "CHECKPOINT / What stayed the same, and what changed?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Continue to a timepiece on page 4, or finish by choosing the detail you would most like someone else to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Footer",
      "text": "EXAMPLE TRAIL / Pattern drawing is invented / 3 of 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Kicker",
      "text": "STOP 03"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "A question about time"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Find an object used to measure or mark time. Check its label if you are unsure. Or use the drawing below."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24PanelLabel",
      "text": "PANEL 1 / EXAMINE"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24DialogueFirst",
      "text": "GUIDE What can looking tell us?"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24DialogueLast",
      "text": "YOU Some answers may need more evidence."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Notice a hand, a dial, a worn area or another feature. Which clue suggests how someone might have used…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24PanelLabel",
      "text": "PANEL 2 / ASK"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Write, draw or think of one thing you can observe and one question you cannot answer by looking alone."
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Response",
      "text": "What I can observe / What I still wonder"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Alternative",
      "text": "Another way: complete the sentences “I notice…” and “I wonder…” aloud or silently. Use the drawing if…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Checkpoint",
      "text": "FINISH / Choose one observation to take with you"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Share it if you wish. To explore further, read an object label or ask staff where to find more…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F24Footer",
      "text": "EXAMPLE TRAIL / Timepiece drawing is invented / 4 of 4"
    }
  ],
